\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.41.png", "id": "25923127443961648", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_25923127447294981_5221699009642254234_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nFL0RD6kBqQQ7kNvwHNxbOG&_nc_oc=AdoZsW11U4CpISNVR6uwGkvnYHCKevDHX8GEi4O_0nlGnG_n3gqzHnbRKS2uf5k44hI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRZNwDntMpQun8ahrhBfpIfw0O9YYfeOOPlDNMNzCjupQ&oe=6B0DAB30"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.10.18.png", "id": "1374499653759686", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_1374499657093019_1388091325729183700_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mx2ImT3Qwf8Q7kNvwH9eY6l&_nc_oc=AdpykVHZ0MsqzCz4x37OgjoIYPJuQBBS855UYg2zsbiVggYfI29f8nV2pjQtWzsKT_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTq2RONtCyU4fzw40K6CXinC9k-9ivn2FnpvYlDCq1rWQ&oe=6B0D9FAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "S-Calculator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A stylish, simple, and easy-to-use calculator with a hidden feature\n\nA stylish calculator app with a design based on black.\nWe have simply gathered the functions needed for daily calculations, pursuing true ease of use.\n\n[Main Features]\n\u30fbBasic Functions: Arithmetic operations (+, -, \u00d7, \u00f7), percentage calculations, and sign switching (+/-).\n\u30fbUsability: Equipped with haptic feedback (vibration) when buttons are pressed.\n\u30fbDesign: Uses an eye-friendly dark mode and a highly readable programming font.\n\u30fbPrecision: Supports input of up to 15 digits, designed to minimize calculation errors.\n\n[Hidden Feature]\nTired of calculating? How about a little break?\nIf you tap the \"=\" button 5 times rapidly while in the initial state (when \"0\" is displayed), a hidden game mode will launch.\nPlease enjoy a simple yet engrossing side-scrolling action game.\n(Game Controls: Jump with \"0\", Return to calculator with \"AC\")\n\nMaking daily calculations a little more fun.\nWe hope you download and make use of it.", "short_description": "A stylish calculator designed in black. It distills daily functions into simplicity, created with a focus on pure usability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Lubyte", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://lubyte.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25542870515338385"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25908324928792940", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "1171448561167102", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25542870495338387", "is_concept":